{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2103159610538680735","created_at":"2026-09-24T16:28:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2103159610538680735"],"id":"2103159610538680735","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1800,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"True reading is not about collecting information, but about engaging in an intellectual struggle with the author. Your goal is not to agree with them, but to understand their framework of thinking, then dismantle it, absorb its sturdy components,","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2103159610538680735"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2103143189590982721","created_at":"2026-09-24T15:23:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2103143189590982721"],"id":"2103143189590982721","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2128,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不同民族是如何隐喻的？\n\n游牧民族说离别，往往会说“赶着羊群越过山梁”；农耕文明谈及感情，常常会讲“细水长流”；海洋文明天然更擅长言爱，因为“明天就要远航”，所以爱要争朝夕。语言不只是表达工具，它更是一个文明赖以生存的生产方式所留下的认知印记。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2103143189590982721"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2103141921636208933","created_at":"2026-09-24T15:18:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2103141921636208933"],"id":"2103141921636208933","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":56,"impression_count":6891,"like_count":174,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":22},"text":"终有一天，你会明白，原来人性最深处的底色，终究是自私与孤独，明白了这一点，便不再向外索求，不再依赖任何人，也不再高估自己在他人心中的位置。别人靠近你，是因为你有价值;远离你，是因为你不再重要！人生不过是一场旅行，生活和工作，都只是旅途中的风景。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2103141921636208933"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2103140849349771437","created_at":"2026-09-24T15:13:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2103140849349771437"],"id":"2103140849349771437","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":3160,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"如果一个女子年纪轻轻便格外通透，\n能于浮华缭乱处一眼洞穿本质，\n\n于众声喧哗中听清自己的心跳，而她来时的路，不过是一片贫瘠的土壤，家境平平，无所凭依，那么你不必追问她的过往，只需知道，她一定吃过很多别人未曾尝过的苦，吞过很多别人避之不及的亏—智慧是一个生命痛苦以后的深入思考。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2103140849349771437"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2103129172424208806","created_at":"2026-09-24T14:27:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2103129172424208806"],"id":"2103129172424208806","lang":"zxx","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1521,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"https://t.co/sej0lgwIo4","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2103129172424208806"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2103089613795664128","created_at":"2026-09-24T11:50:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2103089613795664128"],"id":"2103089613795664128","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":3349,"like_count":55,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":10},"text":"人生最美好的七份礼物：迷途知返、久别重逢、失而复得、化险为夷、不期而遇、如愿以偿、未来可期。生活总在裂缝中投下光，愿你接住每一份意料之外的温柔。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2103089613795664128"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2102791670219890871","created_at":"2026-09-23T16:06:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2102791670219890871"],"id":"2102791670219890871","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4676,"like_count":14,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我发现在推特上抄券商的研报，发过来好像比较吸粉，对于散户做交易并什么用，主要是够不着就觉得牛逼。目前几个过2万的A股账号都是这个尿性！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2102791670219890871"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2102604627237871776","created_at":"2026-09-23T03:43:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2102604627237871776"],"id":"2102604627237871776","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2222,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2092209716445512029","type":"quo